    "constructed_Re2O7_gas": {
      "measured_temperature_range_K": [
        961,
        1087
      ],
      "runtime_continuation_temperature_range_K": [
        1087,
        3000
      ],
      "derivation": "Convert Battles log10(p_atm)=A-B/T to p_bar using p_bar=1.01325*p_atm, then ΔG_rxn=-RT ln(p_bar). For 3.5 ReO2(s)->1.5 Re(s)+Re2O7(g), G_app(g)=ΔG_rxn+3.5 G_app(ReO2)-1.5 G_app(Re). Derive dG_sub=G_app(g)-G_app(Re2O7(l)) from the B677 liquid branch, continued at its last printed Cp above 700 K, and reconstruct G_app(g)=G_app(Re2O7(l))+dG_sub. Above 1087 K hold the derived gas Cp at its 1087 K value and continue H/S; flag the construction and continuation.",
      "declined_ReO3_g": "Battles reports only a <3-5% abundance upper bound, not a temperature-dependent ReO3(g) partial-pressure or equilibrium function."
